[?2004l[?2004h> /**
[?2004l[?2004h>  * ScriptedMockInput exposes a queue of commands to the ApplicationListener one per tick.
[?2004l[?2004h>  * Each call to {@link #tick()} advances the queue and registers the appropriate
[?2004l[?2004h>  * keycode(s) with the headless MockInput so that the listener can read them via
